  {
   "id": "c-p9-b0",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "### Transitive dependency",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 9,
    "blockIds": [
     "p9-b0"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p9-b1",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- Key → A and A → B, where A is not itself a key",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 9,
    "blockIds": [
     "p9-b1"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p9-b2",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- Postcode fixes the city, so the city rides along on the row",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 9,
    "blockIds": [
     "p9-b2"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p9-b3",
