  {
   "id": "c-p10-b0",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "### Third normal form",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 10,
    "blockIds": [
     "p10-b0"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p10-b1",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- No non-prime attribute is determined by another non-prime one",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 10,
    "blockIds": [
     "p10-b1"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p10-b2",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- The key, the whole key, and nothing but the key",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 10,
    "blockIds": [
     "p10-b2"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p10-b3",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- Always reachable, and it can always keep every dependency",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 10,
    "blockIds": [
     "p10-b3"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p11-b0",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "### Boyce-Codd normal form",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 11,
    "blockIds": [
     "p11-b0"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p11-b1",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- Every determinant is a candidate key, with no exceptions",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 11,
    "blockIds": [
     "p11-b1"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p11-b2",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- Stricter than 3NF by exactly one clause",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 11,
    "blockIds": [
     "p11-b2"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p11-b3",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "- The two only differ where candidate keys overlap",
   "source": {
    "materialId": "m-norm",
    "page": 11,
    "blockIds": [
     "p11-b3"
    ]
   },
   "edited": false
  },
  {
   "id": "c-p11-b4",
   "origin": "extracted",
   "markdown": "R is in BCNF when every non-trivial X → A has a superkey X",
